# Migration report

`terradart-migrate {{version}}` migrated `../terradart_coverage/test/fixtures/config_tree` into the Dart package `config_tree`: 8 module directories, 62 blocks became Dart, 20 stay in Terraform (listed below, each with its reason).

## Next steps

1. `dart pub get`
2. `dart run bin/infra.dart` — writes `main.tf.json` next to the sidecar files in every Terraform directory under `tf-out/`.
3. In each root (`tf-out/dev`, `tf-out/prod`): `terraform init && terraform plan` — expect *No changes* against the existing state.

