## Environments

Sibling roots are migrated one Stack each, backends untouched; `--merge-envs` (#668) will fold them into one Stack later.

### `.`: `dev`, `prod`

- Shared addresses: 22
- Only in `prod`: `google_storage_bucket.backups`, `google_storage_bucket_iam_binding.backups_admins`
- Arguments that differ:
  - `google_storage_bucket.assets`: `name`
  - `google_storage_bucket.uploads`: `name`
  - `module.cloud_sql`: `instance_name`
